{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Caput Mortum</strong></i><strong>\u00a0is a short first-person horror game inspired by retro 3D dungeon crawlers and survival horror games. The game focuses on exploration and atmosphere while providing puzzles, simple combat, and light resource management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif01.gif?t=1740679094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a control scheme reminiscent of old-school dungeon crawlers that makes you feel more vulnerable. Control your right hand with the right thumbstick to interact with objects and attack creatures.\u00a0<i>Caput Mortum</i> is meant to be played with a controller, but a more standard keyboard and mouse control scheme is also available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slow Burn Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif02.gif?t=1740679094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the lights, put on headphones, and immerse yourself in the game's macabre world. You'll need to pay attention to the environment to solve puzzles and piece together the events that took place within the tower. How deep are you willing to go, and what terrible truths will you uncover?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nightmarish Beings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif03.gif?t=1740679094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must stay vigilant, as varied monsters roam the abandoned halls of the tower and won't hesitate to attack. Stealth past them or fight back, but be mindful of your health: There is a limited quantity of healing herbs you'll be able to scavenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/WildArts_Logo_MadeByHumans_banner.png?t=1740679094\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555980?t=1740679094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/78972b7e106d883a29e78bce31dd93231850e861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740679094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/c6bb33c5bbd8973f9fde3994219f2b02d76f6892/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740679094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/c6bb33c5bbd8973f9fde3994219f2b02d76f6892/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740679094","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of death; monstrous creatures; experiments on humans; and horror themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Caput Mortum</strong></i><strong>\u00a0is a short first-person horror game inspired by retro 3D dungeon crawlers and survival horror games. The game focuses on exploration and atmosphere while providing puzzles, simple combat, and light resource management.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif01.gif?t=1740679094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with a control scheme reminiscent of old-school dungeon crawlers that makes you feel more vulnerable. Control your right hand with the right thumbstick to interact with objects and attack creatures.\u00a0<i>Caput Mortum</i> is meant to be played with a controller, but a more standard keyboard and mouse control scheme is also available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Slow Burn Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif02.gif?t=1740679094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Close the lights, put on headphones, and immerse yourself in the game's macabre world. You'll need to pay attention to the environment to solve puzzles and piece together the events that took place within the tower. How deep are you willing to go, and what terrible truths will you uncover?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nightmarish Beings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/CM_store_gif03.gif?t=1740679094\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must stay vigilant, as varied monsters roam the abandoned halls of the tower and won't hesitate to attack. Stealth past them or fight back, but be mindful of your health: There is a limited quantity of healing herbs you'll be able to scavenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/extras/WildArts_Logo_MadeByHumans_banner.png?t=1740679094\" /></p>","developers":["WildArts Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555980/header.jpg?t=1740679094","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108013,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108013/movie480.mp4?t=1740679092","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108013/movie_max.mp4?t=1740679092"},"name":"Caput Mortum Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108013/f21e61da9a62eda4d0119495bf62ab2da3a5fdb6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740679092","web